# One line ending in the repository, whatever wrote the file. Half this tree was
# authored on Windows and half through Linux tooling, so every cross-platform
# edit was turning into a whole-file diff. LF is also what the images want: a
# shell script that reaches a container with CRLF in it does not run.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.jar binary
*.joblib binary
*.parquet binary
